0:{"buildId":"0jVyvQ0rFSIQlp018ivgA","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","div",null,{"className":"sm-mb-50 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__commonbanner2","style":{"--bg":"url(/_next/static/media/shopify-banner.821ddd68.webp) no-repeat center center / cover"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-10 sm-px-20 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__content","children":[["$","h2",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Shopify Website Development </br>Company in Dubai, UAE"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-30","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"We‍‌‍‍‌‍‌‍‍‌ create fully personalized, mobile-friendly, and performance-driven </br>Shopify website stores for e-commerce businesses in Dubai and the UAE."}}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/contact-us","className":"blue-btn","children":"Get a Free Consultation"}]]}]}],["$","$L3",null,{"title":"Dev. Services","items":[{"name":"UI/UX","link":"/services/ui-ux-design"},{"name":"Frontend Dev.","link":"/services/frontend-development"},{"name":"Full-stack Dev.","link":"/services/full-stack-development"},{"name":"Static Web Dev.","link":"/services/static-website-development"},{"name":"Dynamic Web Dev.","link":"/services/dynamic-website-development"},{"name":"Website Migration","link":"/services/website-migration-service"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Shopify Website Development Services"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__flex","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":" <p>An online store is not just a website- it is your brand's digital storefront and the first impression your customers get. At Website Development Agency, we are experts in Shopify website development, assisting businesses in designing, developing, and optimizing robust e-commerce experiences that attract sales and brand loyalty.</p>\n                    <p>It does not matter if you are starting a new store or growing your existing business, our certified Shopify developers in Dubai create the perfect solution for you that is a great mix of creativity, functionality, and ‍‌‍‍‌‍‌‍‍‌performance. At Website Development Agency, we create intuitive Shopify stores for major brands as well as e-commerce startups across the region.</p>\n                    "}}],["$","$L4",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/shopify-banner-1.41fbff21.webp","width":628,"height":332,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/shopify-abnner-2.e7991add.webp","width":1256,"height":664,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"  <p>By‍‌‍‍‌‍‌‍‍‌ harnessing a talented team well-versed in e-commerce trends and armed with technical know-how, Website Development Agency, a reputed Shopify development company in the UAE, delivering next-level e-commerce solutions. Our team riffs technical skills along with an inside knowledge of e-commerce trends to invent Shopify stores that change the traffic into loyal purchasers.</p>\n                <p>We are proficient in Shopify, Shopify Plus development, providing a wide range of scalable solutions to startups, SMEs, and large e-commerce businesses. Our stores are made to look great and function at a high level, through the elegant custom themes, smooth payment integration, and support, which we take care of.</p>\n                    "}}]]}]]}]]}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld"],["$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12"],"$L13"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
5:["$","$L14",null,{"text1":"The Preferred E-commerce Platform for UAE-based Businesses","text2":"Shopify‍‌‍‍‌‍‌‍‍‌ has been the major change in the online selling world with the features of the platform that are user-friendly, flexible, and highly scalable. It is the preferred platform for thousands of businesses in the UAE- from small brands in Dubai to big retailers.\n                    <br><br>\n                    The platform is very user-friendly, and it can be scaled up or down easily, plus it is very secure: You can handle your store without writing code. Moreover, the performance is always fast and the security level is high due to Shopify’s cloud infrastructure. Every store comes equipped with powerful SEO and marketing tools, making it easy to optimize for search engines and manage campaigns across email, Facebook Ads, and Google Shopping.\n\n\n                       ","bg":{"src":"/_next/static/media/shopify-main-banner.57f41400.webp","width":3024,"height":1204,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":3,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRr4AAABXRUJQVlA4TLIAAAAvB4AAAM1VICICHgiwCQAAAAC1H5TjxAkAAAAAAAAACAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACAAAAABAACIIWAEAAPBAQE4AAAAAzv//JwEBBgAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACBWzgMBBAEAAAA4/64eAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAakWO9zA2VL680Hb7daTZk+wDiuv82dnh00kaPBi1oisH3rmE"}}]
6:["$","$L15",null,{"heding":"Comprehensive Shopify Solutions Tailored for Businesses","subheding":"We at Website Development Agency offer a complete range of Shopify services that are aimed at helping your brand to succeed online. Our solutions are made to be quick, adaptable, and technologically advanced.","services":[{"title":"Custom Shopify Development","desc":"We create Shopify stores that reflect your uniqueness- perfectly matching your brand, audience, and business objectives. To provide the best user experience, every layout, feature, and functionality of your store has been designed.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/custom-shopify.6b4a9713.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Shopify Theme Design & Customization","desc":"Shopify themes developed by our designers are aesthetically attractive, responsive, and conversion-focused and at the same time creative and UX are of best quality. We can either customize a present Shopify theme or make a new one.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/shopify-theme.812e8766.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Shopify Development & Integration","desc":"Do you want a few custom features or integrations from third parties? We create effective Shopify websites and can also link your store with CRMs, ERPs, analytics, and marketing platforms.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/shopify-development.f465f952.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Shopify Migration Services","desc":"If you are moving from WooCommerce, Magento, or BigCommerce, we take care of the transition to Shopify smoothly and safely with no data loss, no downtime, and no SEO changes.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/shopify-migration.f7a4199a.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Payment Gateway Integration","desc":"We make it possible for your customers to have easy and safe transactions by integrating payment gateways that are trusted and UAE-friendly such as PayTabs, Telr, Stripe, and PayPal.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/payment-gateway.95838107.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Maintenance & Support","desc":"We always keep your Shopify shop in top condition with our team ongoing support, performance fine-tuning, and technical support, available 24/7.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/maintenance-support.161a08f4.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"}]}]
7:["$","$L16",null,{"heding":"Our Shopify Development Process","subheding":"From Concept to Launch- Our Agile Workflow","processData":[{"id":"01","title":"Requirement Analysis & Planning","description":"We begin with an extensive discovery session to comprehend your goals, products, target audience, and features that you would like to have."},{"id":"02","title":"Wireframing & UI/UX Design","description":"Our UX/UI team develops user-friendly wireframes and captivating visuals that not only depict your brand identity but also facilitate user engagement."},{"id":"03","title":"Customization & App Integration","description":"We customize Shopify themes and install the apps that give your store a wide range of new features- from analytics to payment and shipping."},{"id":"04","title":"Product & Inventory Setup","description":"We collaborate with you to upload and organize products effectively, using optimized titles, detailed descriptions, and high-quality images to ensure a smooth and engaging shopping experience."},{"id":"05","title":"Testing & Quality Assurance","description":"Our QA specialists implement detailed testing of your store on various devices and browsers in order to achieve design, speed, and functionality that are faultless down to the last pixel."},{"id":"06","title":"Store Launch & Ongoing Support","description":"Upon final approvals, we get your Shopify store up and operating and provide continuous support, maintenance, and optimization to keep conversions at their peak level.\n"}]}]
8:["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 pt-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-center sm-text-start mb-20","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Key Features We Implement"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-center mb-40 sm-text-start","children":"We‍‌‍‍‌‍‌‍‍‌ utilize Shopify's powerful ecosystem to create feature-rich stores that engage customers and increase sales."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__grid","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__imgbox","children":["$","$L4",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Strategic-Problem-Solving.961c8ba6.png","width":110,"height":110,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/png;base64,"},"alt":"Icon"}]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"my-15","children":"Device-Specific Performance"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We ensure your Shopify store loads fast and performs smoothly on desktops, tablets, and smartphones- providing a consistent and optimized user experience across all devices."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__imgbox","children":["$","$L4",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/FocusedApproach.dc092fb1.png","width":93,"height":93,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/png;base64,"},"alt":"Icon"}]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"my-15","children":"Mobile First Design Approach"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Our designs prioritize mobile shoppers, offering seamless navigation, fast load times, and intuitive layouts that maximize engagement and conversions."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__imgbox","children":["$","$L4",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Partnership-Commitment.6769dc19.png","width":110,"height":110,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/png;base64,"},"alt":"Icon"}]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"my-15","children":"Secure Checkout & Authentication"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"With Shopify’s PCI-compliant infrastructure and multi-layered authentication, your store stays protected while customers enjoy safe, hassle-free transactions."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__imgbox","children":"$L17"}],"$L18","$L19","$undefined"]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}]]}]
1f:T505,<ul>
                                <li><strong>Experienced Shopify Developers</strong> – We are a certified team of experts who are fully knowledgeable about Shopify- from Liquid code to app integration.</li>
                                
                                <li><strong>Custom Design & Scalability</strong> – Your online store will be capable of following your business and will have the option of making further additions of products, categories, and features.</li>
                                
                                <li><strong>Transparent Workflow & Delivery</strong> – We are a team that cherishes collaboration and communication, which is why we keep you in the loop at every stage of the process.</li>
                                
                                <li><strong>Post Launch Support</strong> – The website creation and launch mark only the start of our partnership. We offer continuous support, updates, and optimization.</li>
                                </ul>
                                <p>Join hands with us and get the benefit of our Shopify development, which is the perfect mix of creativity, technology, and business growth that can be ‍‌‍‍‌‍‌‍‍‌measured.</p>
                            9:["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__flex","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__left","children":["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why Choose Us for Shopify Website Development"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__right","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"The‍‌‍‍‌‍‌‍‍‌ right development partner might be a defining factor for your e-commerce success. Here reflect the reasons of UAE businesses to cooperate with Website Development Agency:"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__flex CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__bottom","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__left","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1f"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__right","children":["$","$L4",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/why-wd-agency-shopify.16b60027.webp","width":1256,"height":1388,"blurWidth":7,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Why Website Development"}]}]]}]]}]
